        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click, place, and upgrade your way to the ultimate goal: filling the Main Loading Bar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Click &amp; Place</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag and drop smaller loading bars onto the board. Each one helps fill the big bar—while making ridiculous, silly noises that keep the chaos lively.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/0871173ded3fb6d3b32b64b91d642ac7.poster.avif?t=1761472206\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/0871173ded3fb6d3b32b64b91d642ac7.webm?t=1761472206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/0871173ded3fb6d3b32b64b91d642ac7.mp4?t=1761472206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade &amp; Optimize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your earnings to buy upgrades, unlock new bar types, and discover smarter ways to maximize your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/0850161789c4de2acea7fe9c730066d7.poster.avif?t=1761472206\" width=586 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/0850161789c4de2acea7fe9c730066d7.webm?t=1761472206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/0850161789c4de2acea7fe9c730066d7.mp4?t=1761472206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you play, the faster things escalate. Can you create the perfect setup to watch the screen flood with loading madness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Big Question</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you finally see the bar reach 100%?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/a754ed8802225474e9c52d4c6ed5d89c.apng?t=1761472206\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/a754ed8802225474e9c52d4c6ed5d89c.poster.avif?t=1761472206\" class=\"bb_img\" width=764 height=148 /></picture></span></p>",
