late. Can you create the perfect setup to watch the screen flood with loading madness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Big Question</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you finally see the bar reach 100%?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/a754ed8802225474e9c52d4c6ed5d89c.apng?t=1761472206\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699690/extras/a754ed8802225474e9c52d4c6ed5d89c.poster.avif?t=1761472206\" class=\"bb_img\" width=764 height=148 /></picture></span></p>",
